  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "This is a Voltage divider\nthe purpose is to divide\nthe total incoming voltage\nusing the two resistors.\n\nThe node in between the\ntwo resistors can be \nconsidered as the output\nvoltage, it is the point\nwhere voltage is divided\n\nHow to verify:\nThe sum of the voltages\naccross U1 plus the voltage\naccross R1 should be close\nto 5V\n\nTrick here instead of using\na fix resistor we are using\na variable resistor that changes\nwith temperature that way we\ncan sense changes in temperature",
      "pos": [
        -1050.3891666346406,
        -446.8102991546614
      ],
